#: ../../ml/problem.rst:5
msgid "問題設定"
msgstr "Problem Formulation"

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:9
msgid "線形回帰"
msgstr "Linear Regression"

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:11
msgid ""
":math:`\\{\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}), \\cdots, "
"\\phi_{M-1}(\\boldsymbol{x})\\}` を与えられた基底関数のセットとして、 つぎの線形回帰問題を考える"
msgstr ""
"Given a set of basis functions :math:`\\{\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}), "
"\\cdots, \\phi_{M-1}(\\boldsymbol{x})\\}`, consider the following linear "
"regression problem."

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:14
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"y(\\boldsymbol{x},\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\sum_{i=0}^{M-1} w_i \\phi_i(\\boldsymbol{x})\n"
"=\n"
"\\boldsymbol{w}^\\top \\boldsymbol{\\phi}(\\boldsymbol{x}) .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"y(\\boldsymbol{x},\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\sum_{i=0}^{M-1} w_i \\phi_i(\\boldsymbol{x})\n"
"=\n"
"\\boldsymbol{w}^\\top \\boldsymbol{\\phi}(\\boldsymbol{x}) .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:22
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"実測データ :math:`t` （ :math:`=y_{\\rm true}(\\boldsymbol{x})` ）を集めてパラメータ "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` を決めるのだが、 その値には "
":math:`y(\\boldsymbol{x},\\boldsymbol{w})` で捉えきれない不確定な要素（ノイズ）があるとして、 "
"以下の形で問題を考えることにする"
msgstr ""
"We collect observed data :math:`t` (:math:`=y_{\\rm "
"true}(\\boldsymbol{x})`) to determine the parameters "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{w}`. We assume that the observed values contain an "
"uncertain component (noise) that "
":math:`y(\\boldsymbol{x},\\boldsymbol{w})` cannot capture, so we "
"formulate the problem as follows."

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:26
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"t\n"
"=\n"
"y(\\boldsymbol{x},\\boldsymbol{w}) + \\varepsilon .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"t\n"
"=\n"
"y(\\boldsymbol{x},\\boldsymbol{w}) + \\varepsilon .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:32
msgid "いま、実測データとして :math:`N` 個の入出力セットが得られているとする"
msgstr "Suppose the observed data consist of :math:`N` input–output pairs."

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:34
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{D}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\{(\\boldsymbol{x}_1, t_1), \\; (\\boldsymbol{x}_2, t_2),\n"
"\\; \\dots \\; (\\boldsymbol{x}_N, t_N) \\} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{D}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\{(\\boldsymbol{x}_1, t_1), \\; (\\boldsymbol{x}_2, t_2),\n"
"\\; \\dots \\; (\\boldsymbol{x}_N, t_N) \\} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:41
msgid "また入力だけ、出力だけをまとめたものを以下のように表すことにする"
msgstr "Let us denote the inputs and outputs separately as follows."

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:43
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{X} \\equiv \\{\\boldsymbol{x}_1, \\boldsymbol{x}_2, \\dots, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_N\\} ,\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{X} \\equiv \\{\\boldsymbol{x}_1, \\boldsymbol{x}_2, \\dots, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_N\\} ,\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:47
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{t} \\equiv \\{t_1, t_2, \\dots, t_N\\} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{t} \\equiv \\{t_1, t_2, \\dots, t_N\\} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:51
msgid "\\ :eq:`pgp1` についても、 :math:`N` データ分まとめたものを以下のように表すことにする"
msgstr ""
"Equation \\ :eq:`pgp1` can likewise be written for all :math:`N` data "
"points together as follows."

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:53
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{y}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"y_1 \\\\\n"
"y_2 \\\\\n"
"\\vdots \\\\\n"
"y_N\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{M-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) \\\\\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{M-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) \\\\\n"
"\\vdots & \\cdots & \\cdots & \\vdots \\\\\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{M-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"w_0 \\\\\n"
"w_1 \\\\\n"
"\\vdots \\\\\n"
"w_{M-1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{y}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"y_1 \\\\\n"
"y_2 \\\\\n"
"\\vdots \\\\\n"
"y_N\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{M-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) \\\\\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{M-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) \\\\\n"
"\\vdots & \\cdots & \\cdots & \\vdots \\\\\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{M-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"w_0 \\\\\n"
"w_1 \\\\\n"
"\\vdots \\\\\n"
"w_{M-1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:84
msgid "データ分布のモデル：尤度関数"
msgstr "Modeling the Data Distribution: The Likelihood Function"

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:86
msgid ""
"式 :eq:`pgp2` のノイズ :math:`\\varepsilon` が次の\\ "
":ref:`ガウス分布<gaussian_dist>`\\ に従うとしたとき"
msgstr ""
"Suppose the noise in Equation :eq:`pgp2`, denoted by "
":math:`\\varepsilon`, follows the \\ :ref:`Gaussian distribution "
"<gaussian_dist>`\\  shown below."

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:88
msgid ""
"p(\\varepsilon)\n"
"=\n"
"\\mathcal{N}(\\varepsilon | 0,\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{\\varepsilon^2}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"\\right)}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\varepsilon)\n"
"=\n"
"\\mathcal{N}(\\varepsilon | 0,\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{\\varepsilon^2}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"\\right)}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:99
msgid "出力 :math:`t` もまた\\ :ref:`ガウス分布<gaussian_dist>`\\ になる"
msgstr ""
"The output :math:`t` then also follows a \\ :ref:`Gaussian distribution "
"<gaussian_dist>`\\  as shown below."

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:101
msgid ""
"p(t | \\boldsymbol{x}, \\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\mathcal{N}(t | y(\\boldsymbol{x},\\boldsymbol{w}), "
"\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{\\left(\n"
"t - y(\\boldsymbol{x},\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"\\right)^2}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"\\right)} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(t | \\boldsymbol{x}, \\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\mathcal{N}(t | y(\\boldsymbol{x},\\boldsymbol{w}), "
"\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{\\left(\n"
"t - y(\\boldsymbol{x},\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"\\right)^2}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"\\right)} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:114
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"上記の設定は、 :math:`t` というデータの生成機構に対する１つのモデル（仮定）であり、 実測データに基づいてパラメータ "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` を調整するために使われる。 式\\ :eq:`ml2` のような確率分布関数において、パラメータ "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` の方を変数とみなす場合、これを尤度関数と呼ぶ。"
msgstr ""
"This setup is one model (an assumption) for how the data :math:`t` are "
"generated. We use it to adjust the parameters :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` "
"based on the observed data. A probability distribution function such as "
"Equation \\ :eq:`ml2` is called a likelihood function when we regard the "
"parameters :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` as its variables."

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:118
msgid ""
"複数の :math:`t` が、式\\ :eq:`ml2` に従って、互いに独立に得られたとすると、 その同時分布もやはり\\ "
":ref:`ガウス分布<gaussian_dist>`\\ となる"
msgstr ""
"Suppose we obtain several values of :math:`t` independently according to "
"Equation \\ :eq:`ml2`. Their joint distribution is then also a \\ "
":ref:`Gaussian distribution <gaussian_dist>`\\  as shown below."

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:121
msgid ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\prod_{n=1}^N \\mathcal{N}(t_n | y(\\boldsymbol{x_n},\\boldsymbol{w}), "
"\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)\n"
"&=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N(\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)^N}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{y})^\\top (\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{y})"
"\n"
"\\right)} \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N(\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)^N}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})^\\top "
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"\\right)} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\prod_{n=1}^N \\mathcal{N}(t_n | y(\\boldsymbol{x_n},\\boldsymbol{w}), "
"\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)\n"
"&=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N(\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)^N}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{y})^\\top (\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{y})"
"\n"
"\\right)} \\\\\n"
"&=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N(\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)^N}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})^\\top "
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"\\right)} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/problem.rst:139
msgid "以降の議論においても、多くの場面で、式\\ :eq:`ml3` を尤度関数として採用する。"
msgstr ""
"We will use Equation \\ :eq:`ml3` as the likelihood function in many of "
"the discussions that follow."

